cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this resource, please cite the accompanying article and this repository."
title: "RU-RAD-6: Violent-Radicalization Discourse Indicators for Low-Resource Code-Mixed Text"
abstract: >-
  A theory-grounded, multi-label annotated corpus of six discourse indicators
  associated with violent-radicalization language in a low-resource code-mixed
  setting, re-annotated from public hate-speech datasets against a purpose-built
  taxonomy, with annotation guideline, inter-annotator agreement evidence,
  supervised detector baselines, and a three-model prompted-LLM evaluation.
